From c83d56d839b10b2da83b4f79513d76fbf6078e71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:20:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mechanics library: icons, two columns and a hint line, as the
 menus

The mechanics teacher's topics are laid out as the field Psynergy and Item
menus are: a name window, the topics in two columns, each with an icon
(Weaken, a Venus Star, Long Sword, Sol Blade, Sleep, Ragnarok) and its
name, and a line about the chosen topic along the bottom
(MsgArenaMechHint0 to 5). UiList gains grids (UiList_SetGrid: Left and
Right move an entry, Up and Down a line) and icons per entry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ta8ykfbWFo924wEqysLhg
