+/// topic, B returns -1. Classic layout: the windows stacked at the bottom of
+/// the screen, 16-pixel rows; touch layout: a header with Back, then the
+/// topics in UI_ROW_HEIGHT rows across the full width. The windows close
+/// before returning, so the topic's text can be shown. Far-called from the
